Release <%= it.date %>

> This PR body is auto-generated. Manual edits will be overwritten.

### Summary
<%~ await it.llm(`Summarize all PRs in 3-5 bullet points.
Group related PRs by theme with PR numbers.

Example format:
- Authentication improvements and session handling (#12, #15)
- Performance optimization for dashboard (#13, #20)
- Bug fixes in user management (#14, #16)

Do NOT list each PR separately. Focus on release overview.`) %>

### Included Pull Requests
<% it.pullRequests.forEach(pr => { %>
- [ ] #<%= pr.number %> <%= pr.title %> (@<%= pr.author %>)
<% }) %>

### Verification Checklist
<%~ await it.llm(`List verification items to check before release.
Place critical checks first with :warning: prefix.
Include relevant PR numbers.
Format as markdown checkboxes using "- [ ]" prefix.
Example:
- [ ] :warning: Critical item to check
- [ ] Normal item to check`) %>
